WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:20.000
[音乐] 大钟寺钟声:五记低沉钟鸣,渐密
[Music] Dazhongsi bells: five deep strikes, quickening

00:20.000 --> 00:54.000
[音乐] 轨道节奏进入,五声音阶逐步爬升(以迭代换爬升)
[Music] Rail rhythm enters; a pentatonic motif climbs step by step (climb by iteration)

00:54.000 --> 01:18.000
[音乐] 折返:旋律先退两步、换向,再爬得更高
[Music] The switchback: the motif steps back, reverses, then climbs higher

01:18.000 --> 01:40.000
[音乐] 登顶:高低编钟合鸣,渐弱收束
[Music] Summit: high and low chimes together, fading to close

NOTE
纯器乐,无人声。全曲为代码加法合成(钟形非谐泛音列),无采样。
Instrumental only, no speech. Entirely code-synthesized (inharmonic bell partials), no samples.
